'''White Day''' (ホワイトデーガチャ, ''Howaito Dē Gacha'', '''White Day Gacha''') is a Seasonal Gacha Event that appears all of March. It features 4 new Ubers: [[Lovestruck Lesser Demon (Uber Rare Cat)|Lovestruck Lesser Demon]], [[White Butler Vigler (Uber Rare Cat)|White Butler Vigler]], [[Frozen Rose Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Frozen Rose Cat]] and [[The Amazing Catman (Uber Rare Cat)|The Amazing Catman]].

==Chances==
{{GachaChances
|UberChance = 5%
