==Trivia==

* This banner is named after the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/White_Day eponymous Japanese observance] as a counterpart to Valentine's day.

*White Day Capsules, [[Xmas Gals (Gacha Event)|Xmas Gals]] and [[June Bride (Gacha Event)|June Bride]] are the only seasonal Gacha Events without an exclusive [[Neneko (Super Rare Cat)|Neneko]].

